  {
   "e": "✅",
   "h": "Вже зробила — і результат зараз",
   "html": "<p>Present Perfect — про минулу дію, важливу <b>зараз</b>: результат видно, а коли саме — не важливо.</p>\n        <div class=\"rule-box\"><b>have / has</b> + третя форма дієслова</div>\n        <div class=\"ex\"><div><div class=\"en\">I <b>have finished</b> my homework.</div><div class=\"ua\">Я зробила домашнє (і тепер вільна).</div></div><button class=\"say round\" data-say=\"I have finished my homework.\">🔊</button></div>\n        <div class=\"ex\"><div><div class=\"en\">She <b>has lost</b> her keys.</div><div class=\"ua\">Вона загубила ключі (і зараз їх немає).</div></div><button class=\"say round\" data-say=\"She has lost her keys.\">🔊</button></div>\n        <table class=\"t\"><tr><td>I / you / we / they</td><td><b>have</b> (I've)</td></tr><tr><td>he / she / it</td><td><b>has</b> (she's)</td></tr></table>"
  },
  {
   "e": "3️⃣",
   "h": "Третя форма",
   "html": "<p>Правильні дієслова: третя форма = -ed (played, cleaned, finished). Неправильні — своя:</p>\n        <table class=\"t\"><tr><td>be</td><td><b>been</b></td><td style=\"padding:4px 0;width:44px\"><button class=\"say round\" data-say=\"be, been\">🔊</button></td></tr><tr><td>go</td><td><b>gone</b></td><td style=\"padding:4px 0;width:44px\"><button class=\"say round\" data-say=\"go, gone\">🔊</button></td></tr><tr><td>see</td><td><b>seen</b></td><td style=\"padding:4px 0;width:44px\"><button class=\"say round\" data-say=\"see, seen\">🔊</button></td></tr><tr><td>do</td><td><b>done</b></td><td style=\"padding:4px 0;width:44px\"><button class=\"say round\" data-say=\"do, done\">🔊</button></td></tr><tr><td>eat</td><td><b>eaten</b></td><td style=\"padding:4px 0;width:44px\"><button class=\"say round\" data-say=\"eat, eaten\">🔊</button></td></tr><tr><td>write</td><td><b>written</b></td><td style=\"padding:4px 0;width:44px\"><button class=\"say round\" data-say=\"write, written\">🔊</button></td></tr><tr><td>take</td><td><b>taken</b></td><td style=\"padding:4px 0;width:44px\"><button class=\"say round\" data-say=\"take, taken\">🔊</button></td></tr><tr><td>give</td><td><b>given</b></td><td style=\"padding:4px 0;width:44px\"><button class=\"say round\" data-say=\"give, given\">🔊</button></td></tr><tr><td>break</td><td><b>broken</b></td><td style=\"padding:4px 0;width:44px\"><button class=\"say round\" data-say=\"break, broken\">🔊</button></td></tr><tr><td>buy</td><td><b>bought</b></td><td style=\"padding:4px 0;width:44px\"><button class=\"say round\" data-say=\"buy, bought\">🔊</button></td></tr><tr><td>make</td><td><b>made</b></td><td style=\"padding:4px 0;width:44px\"><button class=\"say round\" data-say=\"make, made\">🔊</button></td></tr><tr><td>have</td><td><b>had</b></td><td style=\"padding:4px 0;width:44px\"><button class=\"say round\" data-say=\"have, had\">🔊</button></td></tr><tr><td>come</td><td><b>come</b></td><td style=\"padding:4px 0;width:44px\"><button class=\"say round\" data-say=\"come, come\">🔊</button></td></tr><tr><td>swim</td><td><b>swum</b></td><td style=\"padding:4px 0;width:44px\"><button class=\"say round\" data-say=\"swim, swum\">🔊</button></td></tr><tr><td>drink</td><td><b>drunk</b></td><td style=\"padding:4px 0;width:44px\"><button class=\"say round\" data-say=\"drink, drunk\">🔊</button></td></tr><tr><td>sing</td><td><b>sung</b></td><td style=\"padding:4px 0;width:44px\"><button class=\"say round\" data-say=\"sing, sung\">🔊</button></td></tr><tr><td>find</td><td><b>found</b></td><td style=\"padding:4px 0;width:44px\"><button class=\"say round\" data-say=\"find, found\">🔊</button></td></tr><tr><td>lose</td><td><b>lost</b></td><td style=\"padding:4px 0;width:44px\"><button class=\"say round\" data-say=\"lose, lost\">🔊</button></td></tr><tr><td>read</td><td><b>read</b></td><td style=\"padding:4px 0;width:44px\"><button class=\"say round\" data-say=\"read, read\">🔊</button></td></tr><tr><td>meet</td><td><b>met</b></td><td style=\"padding:4px 0;width:44px\"><button class=\"say round\" data-say=\"meet, met\">🔊</button></td></tr></table>"
  },
